---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="IRIS CDC — Early access" description="Explore CaretDev IRIS CDC, an emerging journal-based change data capture pipeline from InterSystems IRIS to Kafka. Design partner enquiries welcome."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="pill">PROTOTYPE / DESIGN PARTNER PROGRAMME</span><h1>Unlock real-time change data from <span class="accent-text">InterSystems IRIS.</span></h1><p class="lede">Introducing IRIS CDC: a journal-based approach to bringing operational database changes into Kafka and the modern streaming ecosystem.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="#early-access" class="button button-primary">Request early access ↗</a><a href="#architecture" class="button button-outline">Explore the approach ↓</a></div></div></section><section id="architecture" class="section"><div class="container product-feature"><div class="product-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE CONCEPT</span><h2>Capture changes closer to the source.</h2><p>Traditional integration patterns often rely on application code, triggers or polling. IRIS CDC explores a different route: processing journal changes and transaction boundaries, decoding selected data and streaming structured events to Kafka.</p><p>The goal is to make real-time data integration easier to operate without requiring every consuming application to understand the underlying IRIS storage model.</p><div class="notice">This is an early-stage technology concept and prototype. Performance, version compatibility, operational characteristics and production suitability are not yet publicly validated.</div></div><div class="architecture"><div class="arch-label">REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE · CONCEPTUAL</div><div class="arch-node">InterSystems IRIS <span>OPERATIONAL DATA</span></div><div class="arch-arrow">↓</div><div class="arch-node">Journal / mirror stream <span>CHANGE SOURCE</span></div><div class="arch-arrow">↓</div><div class="arch-node accent">IRIS CDC pipeline <span>DECODE & MAP</span></div><div class="arch-arrow">↓</div><div class="arch-node">Kafka topics <span>CHANGE EVENTS</span></div><div class="arch-arrow">↓</div><div class="arch-node">Consumers <span>DATA / SERVICES</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section section-light"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow dark">WHAT WE ARE EXPLORING</span><h2>Designed around the difficult questions.</h2><p>The value of CDC comes from correctness and reliability, not only from the ability to emit events.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">01 / CAPTURE</span><h3>Journal-level changes</h3><p>Explore change capture without requiring a custom change hook in every application path.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">02 / SEMANTICS</span><h3>Transaction-aware processing</h3><p>Interpret transaction boundaries and ordering as part of event publication and recovery design.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">03 / DESTINATION</span><h3>Modern streaming integration</h3><p>Map selected IRIS data structures into events for Apache Kafka and downstream consumers.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading dark-heading"><span class="eyebrow">DESIGN PARTNER PROGRAMME</span><h2>Help shape what becomes production-ready.</h2><p>We are looking for teams with meaningful real-time integration requirements and a controlled environment in which technical assumptions can be evaluated together.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><div class="process-step"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD FIT / 01</span><h3>Real IRIS workloads</h3><p>You operate IRIS or Caché and can describe the data flows, change volume and integration constraints.</p></div><div class="process-step"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD FIT / 02</span><h3>Clear CDC use case</h3><p>You need data for streaming, analytics, search, replication or event-driven services.</p></div><div class="process-step"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD FIT / 03</span><h3>Technical collaboration</h3><p>You can share feedback and evaluate a prototype in a non-production environment subject to agreed terms.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="early-access" class="section"><div class="container two-col"><div><span class="eyebrow">EARLY ACCESS</span><h2>Tell us what you are building.</h2><p class="lede">This is an initial expression of interest, not a commitment to a trial. We will review fit and discuss evaluation options with selected teams.</p><div class="soft-panel"><h3>What happens next?</h3><p>Complete the short enquiry. Your email client will open a prepared message to info@caretdev.com. You choose whether to send it.</p><p class="smallprint">No form data is transmitted to CaretDev unless you send the email. A hosted form backend can be added before public launch.</p></div></div><div class="soft-panel"><form class="form" id="interest-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Full name" /></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Work email *</label><input id="email" name="email" required type="email" maxlength="200" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" /></div></div><div class="field"><label for="company">Company / organisation *</label><input id="company" name="company" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Organisation name" /></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="version">IRIS / Caché version</label><input id="version" name="version" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. IRIS 2025.x" /></div><div class="field"><label for="streaming">Destination</label><select id="streaming" name="streaming"><option value="Kafka">Kafka</option><option value="Other streaming / data platform">Other streaming / data platform</option><option value="Still evaluating">Still evaluating</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="challenge">Your CDC use case *</label><textarea id="challenge" name="challenge" required maxlength="2000" placeholder="What changes do you need to capture, at what scale, and why?"></textarea></div><p class="form-note">We only use information you choose to send to respond to your enquiry. See our <a href={`${base}privacy/`}>privacy notice</a>.</p><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">Prepare enquiry email ↗</button><p id="interest-status" class="form-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></div></section><script>
  document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#interest-form')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const data=new FormData(form);const fields=['name','email','company','version','streaming','challenge'];const body=fields.map(key=>`${key.toUpperCase()}: ${String(data.get(key)||'Not provided')}`).join('\n\n');const url=`mailto:info@caretdev.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent('IRIS CDC - Early Access Enquiry')}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;const status=document.querySelector('#interest-status');if(status)status.textContent='Your email application should open. Review and send the draft to submit your enquiry.';window.location.href=url;});
</script></Layout>
